text_frame=choose("Steel remembers the hand that shapes it. Let us see what you have brought.","Every blade has a story. If you listen close, I can help it speak louder.","Fire is hot, and Iron is honest. If it can be reforged, I will find a way.","You made it back alive. That is a good start. Now let us make your gear do the same.","Place your iron. I will do the rest.")
wait=10